    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Baby, Child, Teenage \\u0026 Adult Circumcision in Luton\",\"title\":\"Circumcision in Luton\",\"lede\":\"Beverley Clinic provides circumcision for babies, children, teenagers and adults from Luton and the surrounding areas.\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Visit us\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\"},{\"label\":\"Luton\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our main circumcision clinic is Beverley Clinic in Edgware, North-West London, where we provide our regular circumcision service.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For patients who specifically want their circumcision performed in Luton, we can arrange the procedure at clinical premises in Luton.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading display d-3\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-3\">Luton Circumcision Location</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Liverpool Road Health Centre</strong><br>9 Mersey Place<br>Luton<br>LU1 1HH</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Because the Luton clinical facilities are arranged and hired specifically for the patient's appointment, having the procedure in Luton costs more than attending our main clinic in Edgware.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you would prefer the more economical option, you are welcome to travel from Luton to our main London clinic.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Please contact us to discuss a Luton circumcision appointment, availability and the arrangements for you or your child.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#enquire\">Enquire about Luton circumcision</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\">View our London clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"patients-from-luton\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"patients-from-luton\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Circumcision for Patients from Luton\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"Patients from Luton have two options when choosing Beverley Clinic.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Have the circumcision in Luton\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIf you specifically want the procedure performed in Luton, we can arrange your circumcision at:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLiverpool Road Health Centre\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e9 Mersey Place\\u003cbr\\u003eLuton\\u003cbr\\u003eLU1 1HH\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe arrange the clinical facilities specifically for the patient\\u0026#039;s appointment. For this reason, having the procedure in Luton costs more than attending our main clinic in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePlease contact us for availability and further information.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Contact us about Luton\",\"ctaUrl\":\"#enquire\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\"},{\"title\":\"Attend our main clinic in Edgware\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAlternatively, patients from Luton can travel to our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware, North-West London.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis is where we provide our regular circumcision service and is the more economical option for patients who are happy to travel from Luton.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBeverley Clinic\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e78 Beverley Drive\\u003cbr\\u003eEdgware\\u003cbr\\u003eNorth-West London\\u003cbr\\u003eHA8 5NE\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"View our London clinic\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn\",\"cta2Label\":\"Get directions\",\"cta2Url\":\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1\\u0026query=78%20Beverley%20Drive%2C%20Edgware%20HA8%205NE\",\"cta2Class\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"all-ages\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"all-ages\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Circumcision in Luton for All Ages\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We provide circumcision for babies, toddlers, children, teenagers and adults.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The method used is selected according to the patient's age, anatomy, foreskin development, reason for circumcision and individual circumstances.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Baby Circumcision in Luton\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe regularly perform circumcision for newborn babies and infants.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor babies and younger children where clinically suitable, we may use a Plastibell or Circumplast ring technique.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eParents receive preparation information before the appointment together with detailed guidance about caring for their baby following circumcision.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Baby circumcision →\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/babies/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Child \\u0026 Teenage Circumcision in Luton\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide circumcision for younger children, older children and teenagers for religious, cultural, personal and medical reasons.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe circumcision technique depends on the child\\u0026#039;s age, anatomy and individual circumstances.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Child \\u0026 teenage circumcision →\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/children/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Adult Circumcision in Luton\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAdults can contact us about circumcision for personal, religious, cultural or medical reasons.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eFor older patients, we commonly use a forceps-guided circumcision technique with thermal cautery.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWound closure may involve dissolvable stitches, medical skin glue, a combination of the two or occasionally neither, depending on the individual procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Adult circumcision →\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/adults/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"medical-circumcision\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"medical-circumcision\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Medical Circumcision in Luton\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We also see patients from Luton who require circumcision because of a medical or foreskin problem.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>This includes patients with:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Phimosis\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA tight or scarred foreskin that cannot be comfortably retracted.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read about phimosis →\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Recurrent Balanitis\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eRepeated episodes of inflammation affecting the foreskin and glans.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read about balanitis →\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/balanitis/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"BXO / Lichen Sclerosis\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eA condition that can cause whitening, tightening and progressive scarring of the foreskin.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read about BXO / lichen sclerosis →\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/bxo/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"},{\"title\":\"Other foreskin problems\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eIf you have a foreskin problem and are unsure whether circumcision is appropriate, contact us and explain the problem so that we can advise you about the appropriate appointment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"32px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\" style=\"margin-top:32px\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For the foreskin conditions we treat surgically at Beverley Clinic, circumcision is the treatment we provide.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"religious-and-cultural\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"religious-and-cultural\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Religious \\u0026 Cultural Circumcision in Luton\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"We welcome families and adult patients from Luton seeking circumcision for religious or cultural reasons.\"} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our focus is on providing circumcision in an appropriate clinical environment, with clear information before the procedure and detailed aftercare afterwards.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/religious/\">Religious &amp; cultural circumcision →</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-card edge\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"why-patients-choose-us\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-card edge\" id=\"why-patients-choose-us\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Why Patients Choose Beverley Clinic\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-3\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Circumcision is a core part of our clinical work\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eCircumcision is part of our day-to-day clinical work, rather than an occasional procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOur practitioners have extensive experience in circumcision and have also trained doctors from the UK and abroad in circumcision techniques and patient care.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Babies, children, teenagers and adults\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide circumcision across a wide range of ages, from babies through to adults.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis experience is important because circumcising a young baby is different from circumcising an older child, teenager or adult.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Individual approach\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eWe do not use the same circumcision method for every patient.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe appropriate technique is selected according to factors including age, anatomy, foreskin development, reason for circumcision and findings on examination.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Preparation and aftercare\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eGood circumcision care includes what happens before and after the procedure, not simply the procedure itself.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePatients and parents receive preparation information before treatment and detailed written aftercare afterwards.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Follow-up care\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOur care does not simply finish when the patient leaves.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe provide support during the healing period and can arrange an in-person review where required.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAny in-person follow-up appointments following a Luton procedure take place at our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Trusted by patients and parents\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eThousands of patients and parents have shared feedback about their experience of Beverley Clinic through Google, Trustpilot, Yell and feedback sent directly to the clinic.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eMany new patients also come to us following recommendations from previous patients, family members and friends.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Read patient reviews →\",\"ctaUrl\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/testimonials/\",\"ctaClass\":\"btn btn-ghost\"}]} /--></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"our-approach\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"our-approach\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Our Approach to Circumcision\",\"display\":\"d-2\",\"lede\":\"The circumcision method used depends on the individual patient.\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Plastibell \\u0026 Circumplast Circumcision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eFor babies and younger children where clinically suitable, we may use a Plastibell or Circumplast ring method.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe ring is positioned over the glans beneath the foreskin and the foreskin is secured around it. The ring remains in place following the procedure and normally separates naturally during healing.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eParents receive detailed aftercare instructions explaining how to care for the circumcision at home.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Forceps-Guided Circumcision\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eFor older children, teenagers and adults, we commonly use a forceps-guided circumcision technique with thermal cautery.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe wound may be managed using dissolvable stitches, medical skin glue, a combination of the two or occasionally neither depending on the individual procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/\">Learn more about circumcision →</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"bg-warm\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"follow-up\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section bg-warm\" id=\"follow-up\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Follow-Up After Circumcision in Luton\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you choose to have the procedure in Luton, your circumcision will take place at:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Liverpool Road Health Centre</strong><br>9 Mersey Place<br>Luton<br>LU1 1HH</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>However, Beverley Clinic in Edgware is our main clinical base and follow-up clinic.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If an in-person review or follow-up appointment is required after your circumcision, you will need to attend:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Beverley Clinic</strong><br>78 Beverley Drive<br>Edgware<br>North-West London<br>HA8 5NE</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Patients and parents should take this into consideration when deciding whether to arrange the procedure in Luton or attend our Edgware clinic from the beginning.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>You will still receive the appropriate preparation information, aftercare guidance and support following your procedure.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/\">Aftercare information →</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"luton-or-edgware\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"luton-or-edgware\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/section-head {\"heading\":\"Luton or Edgware – Which Should I Choose?\",\"display\":\"d-2\"} /--><!-- wp:cil/info-cards {\"columns\":\"g-2\",\"headingLevel\":3,\"items\":[{\"title\":\"Choose Luton if:\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYou specifically want the circumcision to take place in Luton and are happy for us to arrange clinical premises for your appointment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eAs the facilities have to be arranged specifically for the appointment, the Luton option has a higher cost.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"title\":\"Choose Edgware if:\",\"html\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYou are happy to travel from Luton to our main circumcision clinic in North-West London and would prefer the more economical option.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEdgware is our main clinic, where we regularly provide circumcision and where any required in-person follow-up takes place.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /--><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"32px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\" style=\"margin-top:32px\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you are unsure which option is best for you, contact us and we can explain the arrangements.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#enquire\">Ask about Luton</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\">View Edgware clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/faq {\"heading\":\"Frequently Asked Questions About Circumcision in Luton\",\"items\":[{\"q\":\"Can I have a circumcision in Luton?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. If you specifically want your or your child's circumcision performed in Luton, we can arrange the procedure at Liverpool Road Health Centre, 9 Mersey Place, Luton, LU1 1HH.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Is Luton your main circumcision clinic?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo. Our main clinic is Beverley Clinic in Edgware, North-West London.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eFor patients who specifically want circumcision in Luton, we can arrange suitable clinical premises in Luton for the procedure.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Why does circumcision in Luton cost more?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eOur main clinical facilities are based in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eFor a Luton appointment, we arrange and hire suitable clinical premises specifically for the patient's procedure. This means the cost of having the procedure in Luton is higher than attending our regular Edgware clinic.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003ePlease contact us for further information.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Can I travel from Luton to your London clinic instead?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. Patients from Luton are very welcome to attend our main clinic at 78 Beverley Drive, Edgware, HA8 5NE.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eThis is the more economical option if you are happy to travel.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Where will my follow-up appointment take place?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAny required in-person follow-up appointment following a circumcision performed in Luton will take place at our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide baby circumcision in Luton?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We provide circumcision for newborn babies and infants. The appropriate method depends on the baby's age, anatomy and clinical suitability.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide circumcision for older children and teenagers?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We provide circumcision for younger children, older children and teenagers.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide adult circumcision in Luton?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. Adults can contact us about circumcision for personal, religious, cultural or medical reasons.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"q\":\"Do you provide circumcision for phimosis and other foreskin problems?\",\"a\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes. We provide circumcision for medical and foreskin problems including phimosis, recurrent balanitis and BXO / lichen sclerosis.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\",\"anchor\":\"enquire\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\" id=\"enquire\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading display d-2\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-2\">Enquire About Circumcision in Luton</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>If you live in Luton or the surrounding area, you can choose between having the procedure arranged in Luton or travelling to our main Beverley Clinic in Edgware.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading display d-3\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-3\">Luton</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Liverpool Road Health Centre</strong><br>9 Mersey Place<br>Luton<br>LU1 1HH</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Clinical facilities are arranged specifically for your appointment, so this option has a higher cost.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"className\":\"wp-block-heading display d-3\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading display d-3\">Main Beverley Clinic – Edgware</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Beverley Clinic</strong><br>78 Beverley Drive<br>Edgware<br>North-West London<br>HA8 5NE</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our Edgware clinic is the more economical option and is also where any required in-person follow-up appointments take place.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Please contact us and tell us:</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"cil-checklist\"} --><ul class=\"cil-checklist wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>The patient&#039;s age</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>The reason for circumcision</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Whether you prefer Luton or Edgware</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Whether there is a medical or foreskin problem</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"24px\"}}}} --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#luton\">Enquire about Luton circumcision</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/contact/\">View Edgware clinic</a></div><!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/testimonials/\">Read patient reviews</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Ask about Luton\",\"formId\":\"luton\",\"subject\":\"Luton circumcision enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->",
